  unitName: Mireia
  unitId: 50682
  unitNumber: 1031
  description: A gunner girl from another world. Though no traces of activity related
    to her can be found in Grand Gaia, information about her exploits can be found
    in Ishgria. No one knows how she ended up there, but it seems that Mireia didn't
    land in the demon world willingly, but instead due to some sort of accident.
    Using her twin guns to fight the fearsome beasts and demons of Ishgria, it is
    said that she somehow managed to survive the ever-present battles that ensued
    about her.
  summonDesc: Hmm... So it was you, huh?<br>The one who summoned me?<br>Well, whatever.<br>As
    long as I can fight, I guess.
  fusionDesc: Lock and load!<br>Who's up next?<br>I can still put up a fight!
